 "name": "Cursed Seal Expert",
 "type": "feat",
 "img": "modules/jjk5e/icons/techniques/schrift-x.svg",
 "system": {
  "description": {
   "value": "<p><em>Prerequisite: Must have Cursed Mark</em></p>\n<p>Through diligent practice and creativity, you have created new types of cursed seals. You gain the following options:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Blinding Mark:</strong> As a bonus action for 3 CE, you mark a creature within 30 feet for 1 minute. On a hit, the creature must make a Constitution saving throw. On a failed save, they are blinded for 1 minute. A creature can repeat the save at the end of their turn, removing the blinded condition on a success.  </p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><strong>Crippling Mark:</strong> As a bonus action for 3 CE, you mark a creature within 30 feet for 1 minute. On a hit, the target must make  a Constitution saving throw or have either their movement speed halved for 1 minute or disadvantage on attacks for 1 minute (your choice). A creature can repeat the save at the end of their turn, ending the effect on a success.</p>\n</li>\n</ul>",
